    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "747 UTA",
      "Premiere\nGalaxy\nBOEING 747-200\nUTA met en service les Boeing\n747-200, les jumbos spécialement\ncongus pour les longues distances.\n\"confort à la française\"\ngros\ndecoration les couleurs lumineuses de\nLomblance de la cabine\nTTG00CO\nonfortablement installe, vous\nYour erase is done un ormosphere\ndétendue et choleureuse\nUTA introduces the Boeing\n747-200, a special long-distance Dersion\nof the Jumbo, onto its\n5 the umbe Mids tastes Sinkin-fast\nAsia and the Paciiic.\n\"à la francaise\"\n\"Roomy as a 747\" - the most\nspacious of all wide-bodied aircrafl. The\nlight of the French Riviera. Pictures by\nthe French Impressionists set the tone in\nsmooth inflight seroice, \"a la francaise\".\npremière de luxe\nEserve 6 16 grands vovodeurs\nPen due de tue cest\ndes oUTA raménage a leur intention\npremière de luxe\nThe\n\"première de luxe\" class\nhighest standards of service with the\nspacious traditions of the great\ntransatlantic liners.\nThe seroice is refined and\npersonal, but \"premiere de luxe\" offers\nsomething rarer still: stace to stretch out\nfor the forward cabin of the 747 is\nreserved for 16 men\nspecial passengers.\nclasse galaxy\nco Au pont supérieur du 747, la\n26 passaders seuler\nenregistrement et un\ngalaxy class\nhe ubber-deck lounge on th\nITA 747 will accomodate 26 seasoner\ntravellers in comfort.\nPassengers who\ndemand nothing but the best on a long\nhaul flight: space, peace and quiet,\nHore, in refined\nwoundings they con enin free\nThe bar is open throughout the /licht.\narpersonel de bord speclalement\nTo help you arrive full rested,\nIT has desired and installed unique\nsleeper-seals on its long-distance network\nbetroten France, the Middle East, South-",
      "-UTA\naménagement\n16 Première de Luxe à l'avant\nvivez à la française, voyagez sur les nouveaux 747 UTA.\ncome aboard the new 747 UTA - fly \"à la française\"\npassenger accomodation:\n\"première de luxe\" (forward\nGalaxy Classe on upper deck,\nTourist Class.\nCinema: Transcom system + 10 music\nperformances\nPoids maximum au décollage\nMaximum takeoff weight.\n80 km) à pleine charge,\npassager).\nCapacité des soutes de fret\nMaximum thrust at takeoff\nCargo hold capacity..\nAverage cruising altitude\n. 60.8 tons\n32 m 1. 57 pl\n4 General Electric CF 6 - 50 E2\n14 ton\n10,667 metres - 35,000 feer"
